    {
      "id": "hero",
      "type": "hero.developer-blueprint",
      "content": {
        "overline": "[ CORVALE DEVELOPERS ]",
        "headline": "Draft. Test. Ship.",
        "subhead": "Connect your sales tools through the HTTP API, the app kit or the hub.",
        "primaryCta": {
          "label": "Read docs",
          "href": "#",
          "variant": "primary"
        },
        "secondaryCta": {
          "label": "App gallery",
          "href": "#",
          "variant": "outline"
        },
        "illustration": {
          "assetRole": "illustration.reference-art",
          "assetRef": "ref:src/components/platform/developers/Illustrations.jsx#HeroArt",
          "alt": "Line-art wireframe"
        }
      },
      "motion": {
        "patterns": [
          "static"
        ],
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none-needed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "api",
      "type": "features.blueprint-cards",
      "variant": "cards",
      "content": {
        "heading": {
          "lead": "Wire Corvale into any toolset.",
          "continuation": "Start with a straightforward REST API that is secure and made to scale."
        },
        "button": {
          "label": "Read docs",
          "href": "#"
        },
        "cards": [
          {
            "index": "01",
            "body": "Ship custom integrations that can both read and edit any record.",
            "illustration": {
              "assetRole": "illustration.reference-art",
              "assetRef": "ref:src/components/platform/developers/Illustrations.jsx#RestArt",
              "alt": "Request diagram"
            }
          },
          {
            "index": "02",
            "body": "Subscribe to webhooks and react to events in code.",
            "illustration": {
              "assetRole": "illustration.reference-art",
              "assetRef": "ref:src/components/platform/developers/Illustrations.jsx#WebhookArt",
              "alt": "Webhook diagram"
            }
          },
          {
            "index": "03",
            "body": "Grant scoped access to apps through OAuth 2.0 flows.",
            "illustration": {
              "assetRole": "illustration.reference-art",
              "assetRef": "ref:src/components/platform/developers/Illustrations.jsx#OAuthArt",
              "alt": "OAuth diagram"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "motion": {
        "patterns": [
          "static"
        ],
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none-needed"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t1",
      "type": "testimonial.quote",
      "variant": "blueprint-portrait",
      "content": {
        "quote": "I gravitate toward platforms that trust their builders — frameworks that hand you sturdy parts instead of a sealed box. The Corvale SDK hands the decisions and the control back to engineers.",
        "person": {
          "name": "Ruth Adeyo",
          "role": "Platform lead",
          "fictional": true
        },
        "portrait": {
          "assetRole": "person.reference-portrait",
          "assetRef": "ref:src/components/platform/developers/Testimonial.jsx#Portrait",
          "alt": "Dithered portrait"
        }
      },
      "motion": {
        "patterns": [
          "word-reveal-scroll"
        ],
        "reducedMotionFallback": "static-final-state"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sdk",
      "type": "features.blueprint-cards",
      "variant": "cards-with-quote",
      "content": {
        "heading": {
          "lead": "Make Corvale fit your team.",
          "continuation": "Extend it with TypeScript and React using the App SDK."
        },
        "button": {
          "label": "Read docs",
          "href": "#"
        },
        "cards": [
          {
            "index": "01",
            "body": "Pick where your app appears: record actions, side panels, or highlighted text inside Corvale.",
            "illustration": {
              "assetRole": "illustration.reference-art",
              "assetRef": "ref:src/components/platform/developers/Illustrations.jsx#EntryPointsArt",
              "alt": "Entry points"
            }
          },
          {
            "index": "02",
            "body": "Build forms, then declare the fields and validation rules your data needs.",
            "illustration": {
              "assetRole": "illustration.reference-art",
              "assetRef": "ref:src/components/platform/developers/Illustrations.jsx#FormArt",
              "alt": "Form"
            }
          },
          {
            "index": "03",
            "body": "Call server functions to read, write, or clean up data held by third parties.",
            "illustration": {
              "assetRole": "illustration.reference-art",
              "assetRef": "ref:src/components/platform/developers/Illustrations.jsx#FunctionsArt",
              "alt": "Functions"
            }
          }
        ],
        "quote": {
          "text": "Typed end to end, fast to deploy, and easy to reason about — what our team needed.",
          "person": {
            "name": "Priya Nandan",
            "role": "Foldline",
            "fictional": true
          }
        }
      },
      "motion": {
        "patterns": [
          "static"
        ],
        "reducedMotionFallback": "none-needed"
      }
    },
